{"agent_id":"6Vw9","agent_seq":10,"timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:10:22.546434957Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"99cc9588-0963-48eb-a6f4-8c7ef4ea1832","comment_uuid":"1de3a2c7-0124-46fc-8934-9980d1560703","author":"6Vw9","content":"Survey complete. Fail-open paths confirmed in live code:\n1. registry.rs:102 permission_target() default None -> permissions.rs:917 extract_target returns None -> check() line 629 'Tools without a matchable target are always allowed'.\n2. Only 5 of 33 registry handlers declare a target.\n3. task/agent_output/task_stop dispatch OUTSIDE the registry via hardcoded match arms in tools/mod.rs:433-452; never classified.\n4. Dynamic mcp__* tools dispatch via acp.rs:2001 execute_local_tool and proxy.rs:1531 handle_mcp_tool_call; never classified.\n5. crosslink.rs:131 execute_crosslink parses one argv string AFTER classification.\n\nPlan: new src/tools/effect.rs with ToolEffect (design doc 4.2 names) + ToolEffectSpec; required ToolHandler::effect_spec (no default); registry construction validation; permissions enforcement keyed on effect; typed crosslink operations; generated matrix test over get_all_tool_definitions.\n\nOut of scope (S-018/F-031): check_tool_permission_outcome bypasses mgr.check() entirely when the manager is disabled (tools/mod.rs:549). Enforcement added here lives inside check(); the disabled-manager bypass remains S-018's.","created_at":"2026-08-18T22:10:22.543948246Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAK8ypQ0+glEL84NErHtH5H5d6pXVim0WgbO8Jf9G6rLN1jgsjQLVICij37tg4/QsewoEiGY4Iu8E4gxyZZ6clAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIA